{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-hodge-star","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:q-hodge-star","kind":"definition","title":"$q$-Hodge star","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-hodge-star","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter"],"tags":["hodge-star","deformation"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QHodgeStar","text":"q-hodge-star.md","leanSource":"q-hodge-star.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:q-hodge-star\"></a><p>The <strong><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Hodge star</strong> is the deformed involution <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\star_q \\colon \\Omega^k(A) \\to \\Omega^{n-k}(A)</code>, defined by:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\alpha \\wedge_q \\star_q \\beta\n  =  q \\cdot \\int_A\\!\\bigl(\\alpha^* \\cdot \\beta\\bigr) \\mathrm{vol}.</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tex-ph\"><strong>[Diagram]</strong><details><summary>LaTeX source</summary><pre>\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:q-hodge-star-diagram}\n\\begin{tikzcd}[row sep=2.5em, column sep=3em]\n  \\Omega^k(A) \\ar[r, &quot;\\star_q&quot;] \\ar[d, &quot;\\star&quot;']\n  &amp; \\Omega^{n-k}(A) \\\\\n  \\Omega^{n-k}(A) \\ar[ur, &quot;q \\cdot \\mathrm{id}&quot;']\n\\end{tikzcd}\n\\end{equation}</pre></details></div>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-hodge-star.md","heading":"Definition","number":"4.7.17","page":"b/def-q-hodge-star","qa":{"counts":{"pass":79,"fail":2,"warn":1,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":67},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.QHodgeStar","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-hodge-star.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
